sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant WD as Workers Dashboard
    participant CHM1 as Chat Modal (Marketing)
    participant CHM2 as Chat Modal (Content)
    participant W1 as Marketing Specialist
    participant W2 as Content Creator
    participant W3 as Data Analyst
    participant TM as Task Manager
    participant API as Backend API
    participant CS as Collaboration Service

    Note over U, WD: User plans multi-worker campaign
    U->>WD: View dashboard for campaign planning
    WD->>U: Show available specialists
    
    Note over U, CHM1: Start with Marketing Specialist
    U->>WD: Click "Email Marketing Specialist #1"
    WD->>CHM1: Open marketing chat
    CHM1->>U: Display marketing specialist interface
    
    U->>CHM1: "Plan Q1 product launch campaign"
    CHM1->>W1: Process campaign request
    W1->>TM: Create campaign task
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create (type: campaign)
    API->>TM: Task created with collaboration flag
    TM->>CS: Register collaborative task
    CS->>TM: Collaboration workspace created
    
    Note over W1, CS: Marketing worker identifies dependencies
    W1->>CHM1: "I'll need content and analytics support"
    W1->>CS: Request worker collaboration
    CS->>TM: Identify required specialists
    TM->>CS: Suggest Content Creator & Data Analyst
    CS->>W1: Collaboration team proposed
    W1->>CHM1: Show collaboration suggestion
    CHM1->>U: "I recommend involving Content Creator and Data Analyst"
    
    Note over U, CHM1: User approves collaboration
    U->>CHM1: "Yes, let's bring them in"
    CHM1->>CS: Approve collaboration request
    CS->>W2: Invite Content Creator
    CS->>W3: Invite Data Analyst
    
    Note over W2, W3: Workers join collaboration
    W2->>CS: Accept collaboration invite
    W3->>CS: Accept collaboration invite
    CS->>TM: Create subtasks for each worker
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create (parent: campaign)
    API->>TM: Subtasks created
    
    Note over CS, CHM1: Notify primary worker
    CS->>W1: Collaboration team assembled
    W1->>CHM1: "Team assembled! Content Creator and Data Analyst joined"
    CHM1->>U: Show collaboration status
    
    Note over W1, W2: Marketing delegates to Content
    W1->>CS: Send task to Content Creator
    CS->>W2: "Create blog posts for product launch"
    W2->>TM: Accept content creation task
    TM->>W2: Assign task details
    W2->>CS: "Starting blog content creation"
    
    Note over W1, W3: Marketing requests analytics
    W1->>CS: Send task to Data Analyst
    CS->>W3: "Analyze target audience segments"
    W3->>TM: Accept analytics task
    TM->>W3: Assign task details
    W3->>CS: "Beginning audience analysis"
    
    Note over CS, CHM1: Progress synchronization
    CS->>W1: Worker status updates
    W1->>CHM1: "Content Creator: 30% complete, Data Analyst: 45% complete"
    CHM1->>U: Show collaboration progress
    
    Note over W3, W2: Cross-worker communication
    W3->>CS: Share audience insights
    CS->>W2: Forward insights for content targeting
    W2->>CS: "Adjusting content based on audience data"
    CS->>W1: "Content strategy aligned with analytics"
    
    Note over U, CHM2: User checks Content Creator
    U->>WD: Click "Content Creator #1"
    WD->>CHM2: Open content chat
    CHM2->>U: Show content creation progress
    CHM2->>U: Display collaboration context
    U->>CHM2: "How's the blog content coming?"
    CHM2->>W2: Process user inquiry
    W2->>CHM2: "70% complete, optimizing for audience segments from Data Analyst"
    CHM2->>U: Show content progress
    
    Note over W2, W1: Content completion
    W2->>CS: Content tasks completed
    CS->>W1: Content ready for review
    W1->>CHM1: "Blog content completed and ready"
    CHM1->>U: Show content completion notification
    
    Note over W3, W1: Analytics completion
    W3->>CS: Analytics tasks completed
    CS->>W1: Analytics report ready
    W1->>CHM1: "Audience analysis completed"
    CHM1->>U: Show analytics completion
    
    Note over W1, CS: Campaign coordination
    W1->>CS: All components ready
    CS->>TM: Mark collaboration complete
    TM->>API: Update campaign status
    API->>WD: Update dashboard metrics
    W1->>CHM1: "Q1 launch campaign complete!"
    CHM1->>U: Show campaign summary
    
    Note over U, WD: Final review
    U->>CHM1: "Save & Continue Later"
    CHM1->>WD: Return to dashboard
    WD->>API: GET /api/metrics/updated
    API->>WD: Return updated performance
    WD->>U: Show improved team metrics 